            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.17</h2>
<p>Tray polish for Settings and update status.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Tray menu label is now “Settings”.</li>
  <li>Under the version, the tray shows “You’re up to date” or “Update available”.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
